{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/0a721c88df253936d8b50d48fe549d69.avif?t=1757781036\" data-has-big width=800 height=238 /></span><strong>EMOTIONLESS: The Last Ticket</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience focused on atmosphere and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are James Anderson, a son returning to the abandoned amusement park his missing father built. Venture into a surreal world inspired by liminal spaces and cosmic horror, where familiar corridors twist into unsettling dead ends and every hallway defies logic\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/92c6c0b919e198c3965f6982ca82ef98.avif?t=1757781036\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span>Search for clues, find audio logs, and navigate a haunting narrative without immersion-breaking combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/f7c71f7b08f43dc30f941eb9d3e50efd.poster.avif?t=1757781036\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/f7c71f7b08f43dc30f941eb9d3e50efd.webm?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/f7c71f7b08f43dc30f941eb9d3e50efd.mp4?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/f8ab705363225a12c17836a57bb23073.avif?t=1757781036\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost, find the right path, and then get lost again. Not every hallway in this twisted amusement park makes sense\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/1bc60bef3636c776c77fc3f1853bf815.poster.avif?t=1757781036\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/1bc60bef3636c776c77fc3f1853bf815.webm?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/1bc60bef3636c776c77fc3f1853bf815.mp4?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/a91696b659b5388a3f2c4274f965c9f0.avif?t=1757781036\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From empty maintenance tunnels to bizarre fairground rides, explore a world that feels both familiar and deeply wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/6eb69dca8cb0c122a50f72325b6395bf.poster.avif?t=1757781036\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/6eb69dca8cb0c122a50f72325b6395bf.webm?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/6eb69dca8cb0c122a50f72325b6395bf.mp4?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/8d8fc22e032b9a5126a0b95d8b4e1742.avif?t=1757781036\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why not take a moment to experience the amusement parks attractions? Just don\u2019t get too relaxed, who knows what awaits on these one-of-a-kind rides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/1413b876a27f05f64a9bba621057e7c5.poster.avif?t=1757781036\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/1413b876a27f05f64a9bba621057e7c5.webm?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/extras/1413b876a27f05f64a9bba621057e7c5.mp4?t=1757781036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570000?t=1757781036","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/f3400e1a0f853999122e6ec45898b3a85cb24f71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757781036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/b845e372f1c9993b37685952f9b96617a6f8c802/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757781036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570000/b845e372f1c9993b37685952f9b96617a6f8c802/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757781036","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom 